{"ID":"20240206101056-0v8yzbo","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240206101056-0v8yzbo","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206101056-0v8yzbo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206101108-r6zccc0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612103841-slanm5g\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240626144346-e4nxokx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:6,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:6\u0026#125;","title":"218龙眼（桂圆）","type":"doc","updated":"20240821132217"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206101108-r6zccc0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206101108-r6zccc0","updated":"20240206101110"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产福建、广东、广西、云南等地。\n【性状】\t为纵向破裂的不规则薄片，常数片粘结。长约1.5cm，宽2"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4cm，厚约0.1cm。棕褐色，半透明，外表面皱缩不平，内面光亮而有细纵皱纹。质柔润。气微香，味甜。\n【性味】\t甘，温。\n【功效】\t补益心脾，养血安神。用于气血不足、心悸怔忡、健忘失眠、血虚萎黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240206101100-ue54acb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206101100-ue54acb","updated":"20240206101100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206101100-v28wzgt.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821130651-06o6r16","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821130651-06o6r16","updated":"20240821130654"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"龙眼"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/龙眼-20240821130651-u14utec.j